 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Comedian — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, you can activate your technique at maximum efficiency. As an action for 10 cursed energy, you activate <em>Comedy</em> for 1 minute. During this minute you gain the following improvements:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Once per turn you can use your <em>Gags</em> without spending cursed energy. You can use <em>Comedy’s</em> negation for free a number of times equal to your CE modifier each round.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The number of props you can create becomes twice your CE modifier. This becomes thrice your CE modifier at 18th level.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The range and radius of your <em>Powerful Punchline</em> are doubled and you can spend 2 cursed energy to deal additional damage dice equal to your proficiency bonus.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>As an action you completely change the scene and scenario into one fitting of the joke you tell, teleporting creatures within 100ft into a cutaway. A target in the cutaway must make a Wisdom save or cannot attack unless they make it fit into the cutaway gag.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
